{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The skies burn as an alien fleet unleashes relentless warships, promising annihilation. <strong>Take control in this pixelated 2D arcade-style space shoot-'em-up and become the savior our home planet desperately needs!</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience classic arcade action with a modern touch:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Orbital Siege</strong> blends elements of <strong>planetary defense</strong> with the arcade shooting of <strong>Asteroids</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense Shoot-'em-up Gameplay:</strong> Face <strong>50 waves of unique alien enemies</strong> and <strong>10 epic boss battles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Your Ship &amp; Defend:</strong> Collect power-ups to enhance your firepower, speed, and defenses. Utilize <strong>3 orb defenses</strong> to absorb enemy fire, deploy <strong>4 homing missiles</strong>, and activate <strong>5 planetary turrets</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dodge and Weave:</strong> Skillfully maneuver through dense enemy fire using precise controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixelated Retro Aesthetic:</strong> Enjoy vibrant pixel art that pays homage to the <strong>golden age of arcade gaming</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556690?t=1752574041","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556690?t=1752574041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556690/790886393cbe11ee7272d7ec60c28501930d5b13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752574041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556690/790886393cbe11ee7272d7ec60c28501930d5b13/capsule_184x69.jpg